flowchart TB
    accTitle: Payment webhook replay ingress
    accDescr: A payment-provider callback is bounded, authenticated, parsed, and fingerprinted before the replay application port performs an atomic PostgreSQL claim.

    Provider["Payment provider"] --> Reader["Bounded HTTP reader"]
    Reader --> Verify["Timestamp and HMAC verifier"]
    Verify --> Parse["Strict parser"]
    Parse --> Fingerprint["Versioned semantic fingerprint"]
    Fingerprint --> Port["Replay-claim application port"]
    Port --> Adapter["PostgreSQL replay adapter"]
    Adapter --> Claim["Atomic INSERT ON CONFLICT claim"]

    classDef ingress fill:#E8F1FF,stroke:#1D4ED8,color:#102A43,stroke-width:2px
    classDef app fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#B7791F,color:#3D2F00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef database fill:#E7F8EE,stroke:#2F855A,color:#173F2A,stroke-width:2px
    class Provider,Reader,Verify,Parse,Fingerprint ingress
    class Port app
    class Adapter,Claim database
